    "title": "Ascension One",
    "description": "With Ascension One, we\u2019re connecting the dots with a new and more personalized account for managing care for you and your family. Find a doctor or location, schedule or manage appointments, message your doctor or care team, pay bills, view test results and request prescription renewals \u2013 all in one place.\r\n\r\nNote: Ascension One is only available in certain locations at this time. We look forward to continuing to expand access in the future.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Ascension St. Vincent's (Jacksonville, FL)\r\n\u2022 Ascension Sacred Heart (Pensacola, FL)\r\n\u2022 Ascension Saint Thomas (Nashville, TN)\r\n\u2022 Ascension Seton (Austin, TX)\r\n\u2022 Dell Children's Medical Center (Austin, TX)\r\n\r\nReady to get started?\r\nRegister online at healthcare.ascension.org/ascension-one",
